WEBVTT

00:04:30.047 --> 00:04:32.193
My 13-year-old daughter
simply disconnected

00:04:32.217 --> 00:04:33.742
and shut up completely.

00:04:34.568 --> 00:04:37.167
My wife also felt
the heightened sense of fear.

00:04:38.919 --> 00:04:41.612
She focused her energy
on securing American passports

00:04:41.636 --> 00:04:42.966
for the entire family.

00:04:44.525 --> 00:04:47.380
She didn't want her family
to go to mosque to pray

00:04:47.404 --> 00:04:51.180
and also explored if it would be safer
for our family to go to Nigeria.

00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:54.095
Our family was traumatized,

00:04:55.253 --> 00:04:57.950
and our fight-or-flight instincts
were in full effect.

00:04:59.958 --> 00:05:01.937
For my part, I was pissed off